  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 784 ÷ 6 × 9 - 30 + 14 = 528\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs and numbers :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 14 and 6, + and -\n\n784 ÷ 6 × 9 - 30 + 14 = 528 ⇒ **784 ÷ 14**__ × 9 + 30 - 6 = 528\n\n__**56 **____**× 9**__ + 30 - 6 = 528\n\n__**504 + 30**__ - 6 = 528\n\n__**534 - 6**__ = 528\n\n**528 = 528 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 784 and 30, + and x\n\n784 ÷ 6 × 9 - 30 + 14 = 528 ⇒ **30 ÷ 6**__ + 9 - 784 x 14 = 528\n\n5 + 9 - __**784**____** x**____** 14**__ = 528\n\n__**5 **____**+ 9**__ - 10976 = 528\n\n__**14 - 10976**__ = 528\n\n-10962 ≠ 528 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 784 and 6, × and -\n\n784 ÷ 6 × 9 - 30 + 14 = 528 ⇒ **6 ÷ 784**__ - 9 x 30 + 14 = 528\n\n0.007 - __**9 **____**x**____** 30**__ + 14 = 528\n\n__**0.007 +14**__ - 270 = 528\n\n__**14.007 - 270**__ = 528\n\n-255.993 ≠ 528 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 9 and 6, ÷ and +\n\n784 ÷ 6 × 9 - 30 + 14 = 528 ⇒ 784 + 9 × 6 - **30 ÷ 14**__ = 528\n\n784 + __**9**____** × 6**__ - 2.14 = 528\n\n__**784 + 54**__ - 2.14 = 528\n\n__**838 - 2.14**__ = 528\n\n835.86 ≠ 528 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
